 wretches at cards. Bar singer Kitty helps him with this dark work, but quickly falls out with him over the division of the spoils. In the fight, Kitty takes all the money from Black and would have had a bad time, if the White Avenger didn\'t come in at the right moment, and defeat the Black villain. White rescues Kitty, but instead of thanks he receives a loud slap from her. Kitty still prefers her Black friend and leaves with him.',0.0639,'/3IQlHP80nkcL9dWhGIGjttWTGoe.jpg','1962-01-01',0,8,1,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1108354,0,'/dVPPCD7wK0bFEB2NK3fw3CBidwd.jpg','28,53,12,','fr','KALI, L\'ange de la Vengeance','Kali: Avenging Angel','Lisa, aka Kali, has nothing left to lose when she finds out her husband has been executed in Rio to cover up a corruption scandal. A former Special Forces recruit, she heads to Brazil with fists, blood and explosives, to find out the truth.',4.7347,'/7GC0TEOQ1ljAhtvcwdthAbb5D3h.jpg','2024-05-31',0,7,135,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1123062,0,NULL,',','zh','复仇者','Avenger','',0.6088,'/dbVaNn7jpsPF54Q0QXkzCbJ4yyJ.jpg','1996-01-01',0,6.5,1,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1133362,0,NULL,',','en','Avengers S.T.A.T.I.O.N.','Avengers S.T.A.T.I.O.N.','Director:  Nicholas Cooper',0,NULL,NULL,1,8,1,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1154598,0,'/oFSQEG1lJTTISj3QKB7cJ9ANkFw.jpg','16,28,10751,','en','LEGO Marvel Avengers: Code Red','LEGO Marvel Avengers: Code Red','The Avengers gather to celebrate their latest victory, but their celebration is quickly interrupted by the mysterious disappearance of Black Widow\'s father, Red Guardian. As the Avengers investigate, they discover that Red Guardian isn\'t the only one missing when they meet a dangerous new foe quite unlike anything they\'ve ever encountered before.',1.9164,'/rDzig50dj7VpLwJ7SThbamETK1G.jpg','2023-10-27',0,6.5,155,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1157533,0,NULL,'28,','zh','绝战香炉寺','Avengement','During the Chenghua period of the Ming Dynasty, at the beginning of the establishment of the West Factory, a large number of forces were incorporated to serve it. The Hu family of Shaanxi was also included. Escort Master Mu was unwilling to succumb to the West Factory, but he knew too many secrets, and Hu killed Mu.The youngest son Mu Xiaobai stabbed Hu\'s eyes and finally escaped.',0.1641,'/sMa4YrB9UkMaqcDeLKo4JB1hzvO.jpg','2021-05-05',0,0,0,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1157621,0,NULL,',','en','復仇者','Avenger','Hong Kong movie',0.2882,'/d7sUmetFUn96ymjDWQsq68QaZPt.jpg','2000-01-01',0,6,1,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1164178,0,NULL,'18,','ru','Золотая голова мстителя','Golden Head of the Avenger','This picture of Alisher Khamdamov is constructed as a legend of Bakhshi, who pulls his endless song about the brave defender of all the disadvantaged Namaz, thereby brightening up the halt of Russian officers who are serving a dull service in the Turkestan region.',0.2351,'/cQ9z0VrxuLNP6Aj6WSM6oN1s7Fq.jpg','1988-02-01',0,5.8,2,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1168015,0,NULL,'99,','ru','Народные мстители','People\'s Avengers','About the partisan movement during the Great Patriotic War.',0.1141,'/D1QpslQSEZ9iCiBr6B5oZsIhOR.jpg','1943-11-14',0,7.7,9,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1215047,0,NULL,',','en','Avengers Assemble: Thor','Avengers Assemble: Thor','All new adventures from Earth\'s greatest superheroes!  It\'s time to celebrate the best of the best, the Avengers Heroes that have saved the Earth from mortal danger (more times than we can count). The Most Worthy of all of the Avengers, Thor encompasses the most honourable traits of a hero and a god. But balancing the responsibilites of the Asgard throne and that of an Avenger is no easy task.',0.0388,'/1q2nRbxxD9KX1Xn8cCFogDeg6O4.jpg','2019-04-03',0,7,1,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1215051,0,'/zdPTpzGnQ0p64v9kiYObAYLGnDQ.jpg',',','en','Avengers Assemble: Captain America','Avengers Assemble: Captain America','It\'s time to celebrate the best of the best, the Avengers Heroes that have saved the Earth from mortal danger (more times than we can count). Known as the Super Soldier, Captain America lives up to his name. From infiltrating the enemy in disguise to being the last one standing in a fight, Steve Rogers is the epitome of a hero.',0.0795,'/prk9hvv7yMA4KyHKLpvtC0fw6Nh.jpg','2019-04-03',0,8,2,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1238834,0,NULL,'16,878,12,','en','Dr. Platypus and the Toxic Avengers: The Probe','Dr. Platypus and the Toxic Avengers: The Probe','Dr. Platypus, Whiskers the Rat and Flaps the Flying Fox were finishing off some work in Dr. Platypus\' laboratory, when they heard some strange messages from deep space on their radio.',0.1016,'/5ORaaAdseIkUoV0grkfmOKKWUtG.jpg',NULL,0,8,1,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1254485,0,NULL,'28,12,35,','en','Avengers: Quantum Encounter','Avengers: Quantum Encounter','While Ant-Man and Wasp demo their Quantum Core, an unexpected villain shows up eager to get their hands on the powerful tech. The heroes need all the help they can get to save the day.',0.0495,NULL,'2022-07-14',1,0,0,'2026-04-17 19:17:40'),(1268644,0,NULL,'18,','kk','Мальчик-с-пальчик и Грибы-Мстители с Марса','Tom Thumb and the Avengers Mushrooms from Mars','Everyone does something nasty in their life. So, scientists sent mushrooms to Mars for certain death, but they returned. In order to get rid of the children, the parents took them to the forest, but they also returned. The battle of the Ogre with children, the adventures of mushrooms and other events taking place in a fabulous rural kingdom.',0.0143,'/bBmZlEmTYmLsCiVU7zqW1FUWhpz.jpg','2006-01-01',0,9.5,4,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1284845,0,NULL,'35,80,','el','Λεζεντάνο, ο εκδικητής','Lezentano, the Avenger','Agamemnon, CEO of Macedonian Enterprises, hires private eye Lezentano to go after beautiful Elena, who is accused of embezzlement. Lezentano intercepts Elena, but things turn out to be more complicated than they seemed on the surface.',0.124,'/rNqqFpv4q7XXGlJrHTMu9U3KnuO.jpg','1988-01-01',0,0,0,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1296022,0,'/sqHn84mCHa7yvhSImV6TTfpQbLv.jpg','18,36,','ja','傑作時代劇 かるわざ剣法','Father Avenger','Master director Sadao Nakajima brings to life the adventures of Shohachi, a ronin (masterless samurai) searching for his father\'s enemy.  O-Tama, the star of a light acrobatics hut in the back mountains of Asakusa, falls in love at first sight with a ronin named Shohachi who appears out of nowhere and, impressed by his skills, asks him to become the troupe\'s bodyguard. Shohachi, who is searching for his father\'s enemy Hyoto, follows the troupe on their provincial tour and finally finds him. But it seems that his enemy is quite skilled.',0.5484,'/okylXdNBwqBZXLEXThesFHDtszM.jpg','1987-04-30',0,0,0,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1346626,0,NULL,',','es','Gatilllo: El Vengador De Los Niños (Jóvenes Ya No Hagan Sufrir A Sus Padres Y Por Favor Dile No A Las Drogas)','Trigger: The Avenger of Children (Young People, Don\'t Make Your Parents Suffer Anymore and Please Say No to Drugs)','Watch this dramatic story where children die from drugs, action, drama, and death...  Vea esta dramática historia donde mueren los niños a causa de las drogas, acción, drama, y muerte…',0,'/kLcpwv0QiUg3Ya47O5EJRtEcr25.jpg',NULL,0,0,0,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1353766,0,'/d1bKi2TRB8iFEz9pE7i5XhcrIkm.jpg','35,27,18,10749,','xx','風流少女殺人事件','A Brighter Summer Day for the Lady Avengers','Taiwan, 1980s. A hot summer day, watermelon juice, and celluloid dreams fuel 15-year-old Ming\'s sexual awakening.',0.3222,'/alcvekyWjaRdCZh1flqr8P5g7BY.jpg','2024-09-22',0,7.8,2,'2026-04-17 19:17:40'),(1359227,0,'/Al127H6f1RXpESdg0MGNL2g8mzO.jpg','16,35,878,','en','LEGO Marvel Avengers: Mission Demolition','LEGO Marvel Avengers: Mission Demolition','A young, aspiring hero and superhero fan inadvertently unleashes a powerful new villain looking to rid the world of the Avengers.',1.8606,'/s3qM33JHOntz2D7o6FGRf5yuI1v.jpg','2024-10-17',0,6.48,125,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1461138,0,NULL,'28,','en','Shaolin Avengers','Shaolin Avengers','Martial Club defend their makeshift school again the ruthless Wolf Fang Clan and their leader, the Wolf Fang Killa.',0.1901,'/AnhWwK51VRqVD4lxXHeCEewrznT.jpg','2025-03-10',0,0,0,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1509784,0,'/otrxE8YbO9C5unZkrPUXMYOl22E.jpg','28,878,','ja','バーニングアクション スーパーヒロイン列伝42 魔討忍 雷花','Burning Action Super Heroine Chronicles 42 - Demon Avenger Raika','The Kisaragi clan has been fighting against the demons known as the Seven Demons for 1000 years. Raika, who inherits her family’s power, puts on a demon defeat suit that causes extreme pain when worn, and throws herself into the battle to defeat the seven demons! Raika accepts as her destiny， even the intense pain caused by having her soul taken into her body to prevent the resurrection of the seven demons she has defeated.',0.1272,'/21NOkJUQBMqqjnZsxMz5dfd0W2h.jpg','2022-05-27',0,0,0,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1524567,0,'/zR35OwL8799Xjq7kmNXpwDF4IoP.jpg',',','en','Avengers Campus | Disneyland Resort','Avengers Campus | Disneyland Resort','A Point of View walkthrough of Avengers Campus that you\'ll love 3000.',0.0536,'/2MTKnW6UOQ2hGxeELk8lDzHIIva.jpg','2025-07-17',0,3.5,2,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1526605,0,NULL,'10751,35,16,','en','It’s Jeff & the Avengers: Merry Shark-Mas','It’s Jeff & the Avengers: Merry Shark-Mas','Jeff is excited for Christmas with the Avengers. He helps Thor decorate the tree but gets tangled in the lights. Thor uses his powers to light up Jeff, making him the perfect tree topper.',0.0286,'/a6KSjbIua1q42dea02vsCzH7kCs.jpg','2023-12-20',0,0,0,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1546214,0,NULL,',','en','It\'s Jeff And The Avengers - Complete Series','It\'s Jeff And The Avengers - Complete Series','Jeff the Land Shark goes on adventures with Avengers like Iron Man, Hulk, Black Widow, Hawkeye, Thor, and more! Jeff has fun all-year-round during Christmas, Valentine’s Day, and Halloween.',0.0357,'/iGDg6r3pDLVVV7KUtiZN2wS30oH.jpg',NULL,0,0,0,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1549589,0,'/517RlXGlkvg0CfQFolwuxkdGGQr.jpg','878,','en','Avengers: Race Against Time','Avengers: Race Against Time','The Avengers must outpace destiny itself in a race against time that will test their strength. Earth\'s mightiest heroes unite in a desperate mission to track down Thanos before he can claim the Infinity Stones.',0.0286,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,'2026-04-17 19:17:40'),(1564058,0,'/5MBqVVijMPVfimKacXRkCaX90w.jpg','12,10751,16,','en','Spidey and Iron Man: Avengers Team Up!','Spidey and Iron Man: Avengers Team Up!','Spidey and Iron Man team up with the Avengers to stop Ultron and Green Goblin from controlling all of the city\'s devices.',0.375,'/aV8K3EevkFNwj41C2MwpjHfrCAi.jpg','2025-10-16',0,3.7,3,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1565356,0,NULL,',','en','World war Avengers','World war Avengers','End of the avengers',0,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1594773,0,NULL,'14,35,','ro','ARIADNA SE RĂZBUNĂ','ARIADNA AVENGES','Ariadna puts a spell on her cheating ex-boyfriend, Victor. Two months later, Victor pays her an  unexpected visit asking for a tarot reading. He needs help making a decision. His uncle offered him  a good job, but Victor has to leave the city for that. Disappointed by the reason of the visit,  Ariadna does the tarot reading, but she can’t tell whether the spell worked or not.',0,'/lkmV5f4Uigfb43Dre12w8ApdjYE.jpg',NULL,0,0,0,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1596657,0,NULL,'53,9648,18,','zh','生有余罪','Avenger','',0.1844,'/giiMZjv6Zi3fOcWToHGgDSarEPV.jpg','2017-01-17',0,0,0,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1655521,0,NULL,',','ja','女復讐人（リベンジャー）　レイプサークルを閉鎖せよ','Female Avenger: Shut Down the Rape Circle','College students Junko and Chiharu find themselves at the party hosted by the president of the party club, Shinozaki. Sensing the danger in the atmosphere, Chiharu leaves, but Junko who stays is raped by the men there. Wanting to help Junko, who is left physically and emotionally traumatised to recover, Chiharu hires an organization that carries out revenge on behalf of their employers. Misaki and Aya, having received the request, approach Shinozaki, a battle-hardened sex machine in a seductive mission. Now it\'s time for a women\'s revenge!',0.1231,'/xz7jpWTl63WnrU8AtGoy9wZUf5G.jpg','2004-01-01',0,0,0,'2026-04-17 19:17:41'),(1657674,0,NULL,'18,','ja','女猫 美しき復讐者','Female Cat: The Beautiful Avenger','A beautiful Filipino woman who had been assaulted is brought to Mai Asakawa, a doctor working at a large hospital. Mai\'s treatment saves the woman\'s life but a few days later, she jumps to her death from the hospital roof. The police rule it a suicide, but Mai, suspicious of the cause of death, goes undercover as a hostess at the club where the victim worked and begins to investigate the truth...',0.6837,'/1fvKcFFvAeg2Ql768WveUHsRcO5.jpg','1992-01-12',0,0,0,'2026-04-17 19:17:41');
